Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: from approximately P24 billion to nearly P50 billion.

2532
02:15:55,420 --> 02:15:57,620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We understand that while financial assistance

2533
