Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: the current system is fundamentally inequitable.

2535
02:16:05,220 --> 02:16:10,560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We observe, our members see that tens of thousands of Filipinos

2536
