Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: are arbitrarily denied of MAIFIP benefits.

2537
02:16:14,240 --> 02:16:18,260
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: They come to us asking for help, yet we are often powerless

2538
