2551
02:17:05,720 --> 02:17:07,760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: equitable, and rules-based mechanisms

2552
02:17:07,760 --> 02:17:12,300
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: that ensures assistance is determined by health care needs

2553
02:17:12,300 --> 02:17:15,420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and ability to pay, not political connections.

2554
02:17:16,200 --> 02:17:19,640
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So ito po yung plea ng mga miyembro po ng HPAC.

2555
