Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Ito po yung apat na plea namin.

2556
02:17:21,440 --> 02:17:25,300
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Una, immediate correction of the 2027 PhilHealth funding gap.

2557
02:17:25,800 --> 02:17:27,440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We urge the Congress and the...

