2559
02:17:29,600 --> 02:17:34,340
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to decisively close the approximately 170 billion funding shortfall

2560
02:17:34,340 --> 02:17:39,460
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and provide PhilHealth with at least the full 244 billion

2561
