Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for indigent and financially incapacitated patients.

2577
02:18:33,480 --> 02:18:35,700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: And lastly, transparency and accountability.

2578
02:18:36,120 --> 02:18:38,500
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We demand full public disclosure and accountability

2579
