Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Every expense category of the Child Protection Program now reads zero.

4260
03:36:50,300 --> 03:36:52,160
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: The House version did not change this.

4261
03:36:53,000 --> 03:36:55,860
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Sa kabilang banda, 500 million peso,

4262
03:36:55,940 --> 03:36:58,220
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: is allotted for school safety and security.

4263
03:36:58,700 --> 03:37:02,040
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: We welcome it, but it's a special provision for security personnel.

4264
03:37:02,580 --> 03:37:05,520
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: A guard at the gate is not a counselor in the guidance office.

4265
03:37:06,200 --> 03:37:10,640
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Sa kasalukuyan, mahigit 2,000 new counselor positions po

4266
03:37:10,640 --> 03:37:12,380
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: ang nasa loob ng new school personnel,

4267
03:37:12,780 --> 03:37:16,120
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: which is still 25% lower than in 2026.

4268
03:37:17,100 --> 03:37:18,440
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: On disaster resiliency,

4269
03:37:19,120 --> 03:37:23,160
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: our schools report full compliance on having a DRRM coordinator,

4270
03:37:23,160 --> 03:37:25,160
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: yet only 24% ng mga...

4271
03:37:25,940 --> 03:37:28,560
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: mga schools na na-monitor natin ay may bagong classroom

4272
03:37:28,560 --> 03:37:30,020
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: or naipagawa ang mga ito.

4273
03:37:30,580 --> 03:37:34,980
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: The House kept the 3 billion peso QRF under the same slow centralized rules

4274
03:37:34,980 --> 03:37:40,700
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: and cut the Safer and Resilient Schools Project by another 944 million pesos.

4275
