Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: kung paano itutuloy ang disaster resilience and preparedness.

4278
03:37:52,580 --> 03:37:54,120
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Transparency in the Classroom Fund.

4279
03:37:55,100 --> 03:37:55,540
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: The House cut...

4280
03:37:55,940 --> 03:37:59,400
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: basic education facilities by a further 3.10 billion pesos

4281
03:37:59,400 --> 03:38:02,240
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: to 27.45 billion pesos

4282
03:38:02,240 --> 03:38:05,560
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: against the 85 billion pesos in 2026.

4283
03:38:06,320 --> 03:38:08,400
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Sa loob po ng Special Provision No. 5,

4284
03:38:08,740 --> 03:38:10,780
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: it lists 8 kinds of facilities

4285
03:38:10,780 --> 03:38:14,220
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: from last-mile schools to inclusive learning resource center.

4286
03:38:14,640 --> 03:38:15,640
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Ang stance po namin,

4287
03:38:16,080 --> 03:38:18,480
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: dapat maglagay ng dedicated line item

4288
03:38:18,480 --> 03:38:21,420
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: para sa last-mile schools at inclusive learning resource center

4289
03:38:21,420 --> 03:38:25,440
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: para trackable at nakikita natin magkano ba yung inilalaan para dito.

4290
