Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Pero taon-taon, nagtuturuan kung kanino hinihingi ng allocation list.

4293
03:38:36,420 --> 03:38:38,040
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Para po sa aming mga citizen monitor,

4294
03:38:38,180 --> 03:38:42,020
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: importante ito para makita natin kung meron bang itatayong classroom

4295
03:38:42,020 --> 03:38:43,840
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: or building sa ating mga paaralan.

4296
