Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Binawasan na naman ng house ito by 3.16 billion pesos.

4298
03:38:55,940 --> 03:38:57,200
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: The last-mile schools,

4299
