Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Ibig sabihin ito,

4305
03:39:12,840 --> 03:39:15,460
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: nakakalimutan pa rin natin ang mga last-mile school

4306
