Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: sa isa kami ng Inet Philippines sa pagsuporta

4311
03:39:31,000 --> 03:39:33,760
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: sa dagdag na budget sa school-based feeding program.

4312
03:39:34,300 --> 03:39:37,140
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Isa pang magandang tingnan ang Wash and Schools program

4313
