Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: ang isang araw na pag-absent sa paaralan

4317
03:39:49,980 --> 03:39:51,580
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: dahil walang malinis na tubig

4318
03:39:51,580 --> 03:39:55,460
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: ay almost one year of learning loss

4319
03:39:55,460 --> 03:39:56,440
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: mula sa pandemic.

4320
03:39:57,560 --> 03:39:59,320
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: Sa inclusive education program,

4321
03:40:00,000 --> 03:40:01,520
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: natutuwa tayo na may dagdag

4322
03:40:01,520 --> 03:40:04,600
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: sa SNED, IPED, at Madrasa,

4323
03:40:04,780 --> 03:40:06,200
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: pero kailangan pa itong dagdagad.

4324
03:40:07,320 --> 03:40:09,020
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: We do not only point to the gaps,

4325
