Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: every classroom and every peso

4341
03:40:48,660 --> 03:40:50,360
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: from allocation to delivery,

4342
03:40:50,820 --> 03:40:52,480
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: fix the gaps, fund the margins

4343
03:40:52,480 --> 03:40:54,960
Multiply-Ed Representative Humphrey Soriano: for an education where hashtag no one is excluded.

