4366
03:41:48,680 --> 03:41:49,660
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ipagpaumanhin nyo

4367
03:41:49,660 --> 03:41:51,440
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: dahil ang aming mga puna

4368
03:41:51,440 --> 03:41:53,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ay hindi lang para sa 2027

4369
03:41:53,400 --> 03:41:55,040
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: gab.

4370
03:41:55,360 --> 03:42:00,640
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kung hindi, halos ilang dekada na nasama ng loob at hinanakit.

4371
03:42:01,360 --> 03:42:07,960
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kasapi po ang Filipino Sign Language National Network at ang Philippine Alliance of Persons with Chronic Illnesses

4372
03:42:07,960 --> 03:42:16,060
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: sa Persons with Disabilities Cluster, Social Protection Cluster, Education Cluster, at Health Cluster ng Social Watch.

4373
03:42:17,540 --> 03:42:24,260
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Hindi po natin mapagkakaila na lahat tayo ay magkakaroon ng kapansanan at lahat tayo ay tatanda.

4374
03:42:24,260 --> 03:42:29,260
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kaya po, ito po ay isang paksa na malapit sa ating lahat.

4375
03:42:30,300 --> 03:42:37,940
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Gusto po namin, Balkan, ang ginawang isang pagsusuri ng Philippine Coalition on the UN Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities

4376
03:42:37,940 --> 03:42:45,480
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: noong 2013 na bahagi ng Civil Society Report na isinumite sa International Committee ng CRPD.

4377
03:42:45,640 --> 03:42:51,940
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Magkano po ba ang ginagastos ng ating pamahalaan sa mga may kapansanan?

4378
03:42:52,220 --> 03:42:53,940
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ito po ay isang proyekto.

4379
03:42:54,260 --> 03:43:01,260
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ito po ay isang proyekto na isinagawa ng mga may kapansanan mismo mula sa isang pananaw ng karapatang pantao.

4380
03:43:02,720 --> 03:43:12,260
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Isa sa mga pinakamahalagang aming nadiskubre at hindi namin alam kung tama ito o meron ng kasunod na ibang aralin,

4381
03:43:13,620 --> 03:43:18,640
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: maging sa civil society o sa pamahalaan, ay kung magkano nga ba.

4382
03:43:18,640 --> 03:43:23,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa susunod na slide, mapapakita namin ayon sa aming pagsusuri,

4383
03:43:24,260 --> 03:43:36,840
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: na 0.0952% ng GAA mula sa taong 2012 at 2011 hanggang 2013

4384
03:43:36,840 --> 03:43:41,820
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang ginagastos ng top four national government agencies,

4385
03:43:42,000 --> 03:43:47,340
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang National Council on Disability Affairs, DSWD, DepEd, at DOH.

4386
03:43:47,340 --> 03:43:52,280
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ilang porsyento ng GDP? 0.01825.

4387
03:43:54,260 --> 03:43:57,560
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ilang bang Pilipino ang may mga may kapansanan?

4388
03:43:58,120 --> 03:44:06,740
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ikinatutuwa namin na mula sa 2020 census at 2024 Community-Based Monitoring System, CBMS,

4389
03:44:06,740 --> 03:44:10,800
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ay naging mas detalyado na ang pagbilang.

4390
03:44:10,980 --> 03:44:18,420
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa ngayon, tinatayang 12.9 million Pilipinos with disabilities ang nasa Pilipinas.

4391
03:44:20,420 --> 03:44:23,740
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Subalit kung titignan natin ang bilang na ito,

4392
03:44:24,260 --> 03:44:30,980
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang 12.9 million na may kapansanan kailangan doblehin

4393
03:44:30,980 --> 03:44:37,940
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: kasi kailangang may isang miyembro ng pamamahay na kailangan magbantay o mag-alaga

4394
03:44:37,940 --> 03:44:43,580
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: at ikinalulukot namin usually ito ay babae, usually ito ay ang ina.

4395
03:44:44,720 --> 03:44:49,440
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kailangan din natin triplehin kasi pag merong may isang may kapansanan

4396
03:44:49,440 --> 03:44:51,700
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: o kahit isang nakatatanda,

4397
03:44:51,700 --> 03:44:57,280
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: kailangan pang liban dun sa ina na hindi na makakapagtrabaho,

4398
03:44:57,400 --> 03:45:00,010
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: makakapaghanap buhay o makakagawa ng iba pa.

4399
03:45:00,010 --> 03:45:08,680
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ay meron pang isang kailangang sumalo sa dagdag na gastos ng pamamahay dahil sa kapansanan.

4400
03:45:09,900 --> 03:45:18,500
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: So effectively, 12.9 million Filipinos with disabilities is equivalent to 36 million

4401
03:45:18,500 --> 03:45:27,220
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: or one-third of the entire Philippine population impacted by disability, directly or indirectly.

4402
03:45:27,220 --> 03:45:34,640
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: What to do? Ito po ang hinihiling namin. Di kami humihingi ng appropriations.

4403
03:45:35,140 --> 03:45:41,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ang kailangan namin ay ang pagsik ng Senado kasi talagang bigong-bigo kami sa Kongreso.

4404
03:45:42,120 --> 03:45:50,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa dami ng iba't ibang NGAs na kailangan magpatupad ng laging sinasabing inclusive kami,

4405
03:45:50,180 --> 03:45:54,240
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang sana pong matutukan nyo talaga ay ang PSA.

4406
03:45:55,060 --> 03:45:57,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Dahil sila yung gumagawa ng censorship.

4407
03:45:57,220 --> 03:46:03,460
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: At kasama na rin ang DILG para merong kaming datos.

4408
03:46:04,240 --> 03:46:09,800
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kasi hanggang ngayon, ang sektor ng mga may kapansanan ay lagi ang laban.

4409
03:46:10,260 --> 03:46:12,080
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pag tinanong kami, ilan ba kayo?

4410
03:46:15,100 --> 03:46:16,500
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Estimate lang po eh.

4411
03:46:17,480 --> 03:46:18,980
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Doon nyo po kami tulungan.

4412
03:46:18,980 --> 03:46:25,660
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Dahil pag may bilang, may ebidensya kayo bilang pamahalaan, meron din kaming ebidensya.

4413
03:46:26,180 --> 03:46:26,980
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Bilang mga...

4414
03:46:27,220 --> 03:46:27,780
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Mamamayan.

4415
03:46:29,740 --> 03:46:32,220
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pangalawa, sound...

4416
03:46:32,220 --> 03:46:33,280
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Bago ko...

4417
03:46:33,280 --> 03:46:36,220
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Bago ko punta doon, yung pong SDGs, isang malaking...

4418
03:46:37,060 --> 03:46:39,200
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Isang malaking, very revealing yan.

4419
03:46:39,360 --> 03:46:44,000
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Hanggang ngayon, labing liman taon ang binigay para sa SDGs.

4420
03:46:44,360 --> 03:46:46,380
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Tatlong taon na lang maglalaps na.

4421
03:46:46,860 --> 03:46:50,500
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Alam ba natin ang poverty level ng lahat ng persons with disabilities?

4422
03:46:51,420 --> 03:46:54,920
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Lagi natin sinasabi, don't leave no one behind.

4423
03:46:54,920 --> 03:46:56,920
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: We are already left behind.

4424
03:46:57,220 --> 03:47:03,520
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Children, persons with disabilities, and all the other marginalized sectors.

4425
03:47:04,120 --> 03:47:07,220
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: What is DEV doing about the SDGs?

4426
03:47:08,340 --> 03:47:11,220
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pangalawa po namin hiling ay ukol sa sound planning.

4427
03:47:12,580 --> 03:47:16,200
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Let us be rights-based, updated, responsive.

4428
03:47:16,980 --> 03:47:20,540
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: I am sorry to say the Magna Carta of Persons with Disabilities,

4429
03:47:20,540 --> 03:47:26,540
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Batas Pambansa 344, or the Accessibility Law, is non-CRPD compliant.

4430
03:47:27,220 --> 03:47:32,060
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: It is obsolete, and it has never been updated.

4431
03:47:32,720 --> 03:47:35,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Let us do something about it.

4432
03:47:35,960 --> 03:47:39,560
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Bakit hanggang ngayon, nagkaroon na ng Filipino Sign Language Act

4433
03:47:39,560 --> 03:47:44,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: na kinilala ang Filipino Sign Language bilang pambansang wikang senyas,

4434
03:47:45,280 --> 03:47:51,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: eh ang pinaglalaban pa rin madalas bukang bibig sa DepEd ay American Sign Language?

4435
03:47:51,180 --> 03:47:56,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Bakit sa RA 12027 na isinabatas itong...

4436
03:47:57,220 --> 03:48:01,020
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Last year lang, tinanggal ang mother tongue.

4437
03:48:01,540 --> 03:48:05,760
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Tinamaan lahat ng tatutubo, pati na ang deaf kasama.

4438
03:48:07,040 --> 03:48:08,260
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: So susunod na slide.

4439
03:48:11,400 --> 03:48:13,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Dito po kailangan nyo ibigay na.

4440
03:48:14,100 --> 03:48:16,700
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kasi napakalapinan ng utang sa sektor.

4441
03:48:17,220 --> 03:48:20,340
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Galingin na maganda yung tanong, yung tungkol sa earmarking.

4442
03:48:21,060 --> 03:48:24,660
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Baka alam nyo na nung second decade of persons with disabilities,

4443
03:48:24,660 --> 03:48:26,660
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: nag-earmark na 1% for...

4444
03:48:27,220 --> 03:48:31,120
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: for all elderly, senior citizens and persons with disabilities.

4445
03:48:31,900 --> 03:48:33,500
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Medyo mahina ako sa algebra eh.

4446
03:48:33,600 --> 03:48:39,520
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ang nakopute ko lang, nung 2003, 804 billion ang GAA.

4447
03:48:40,300 --> 03:48:44,280
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Nung 2012, sa dulo ng dekada, 1.8 trillion.

4448
03:48:45,100 --> 03:48:48,120
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pag isumatutal nyo lang yung umpisa at yung dulo,

4449
03:48:49,200 --> 03:48:53,900
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang utang na ay 8 billion at 18 billion sa sektor.

4450
03:48:53,900 --> 03:48:55,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Wala pa yung lahat nung nasa gitna.

4451
03:48:55,880 --> 03:48:57,480
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Isang dekada yun.

4452
03:48:57,480 --> 03:48:59,480
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Walang terminal report.

4453
03:48:59,480 --> 03:49:03,200
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ano ba nagagawa ng earmarking para sa persons with disabilities?

4454
03:49:03,200 --> 03:49:04,640
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Nakakatulong ba ito?

4455
03:49:04,640 --> 03:49:08,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Nung pumatak ang 2013, tinanggal yung earmark.

4456
03:49:08,400 --> 03:49:12,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ngayon, nandun pa rin siya sa GAA pero wala nang earmarking.

4457
03:49:12,400 --> 03:49:15,600
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pero kailangan may programa, may mga proyekto

4458
03:49:15,600 --> 03:49:19,360
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: para sa senior citizens at sa persons with disabilities.

4459
03:49:19,360 --> 03:49:23,760
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: So ngayon, meron po tayong disability support allowance na inilalaban,

4460
03:49:23,760 --> 03:49:25,760
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: 345,305

4461
03:49:25,880 --> 03:49:32,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: beneficiaries, P2,000 a month for a total of P8.78 billion.

4462
03:49:32,880 --> 03:49:36,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: 2,000 pesos a month, napakalinggit na po niyan.

4463
03:49:36,880 --> 03:49:42,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kung tutuusin natin, ang bayad sa interpreter ay 1,000 pesos na an hour.

4464
03:49:42,880 --> 03:49:50,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Magpatingin ka sa isang psychologist, psychiatrist, batang-bata, 5,000.

4465
03:49:50,880 --> 03:49:54,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Mag-grab ka lang kung naka-wheelchair ka, 500 ka agad yun.

4466
03:49:54,880 --> 03:49:56,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Saan aabot yung 2,000?

4467
03:49:56,880 --> 03:49:59,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pero sige na, umpisa pa lang. Doon tayo mag-umpisa.

4468
03:49:59,880 --> 03:50:05,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pero ibigay po saan na ito sa sektor.

4469
03:50:05,880 --> 03:50:13,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa susunod na slide, ang pangalawang aspeto ng sound planning and implementation ay accountability.

4470
03:50:13,880 --> 03:50:21,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: At meron po kaming iminumungkahing general provision to make the blank visible.

4471
03:50:21,880 --> 03:50:23,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Iminungkahin po namin ito sa house.

4472
03:50:23,880 --> 03:50:27,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Wala po kaming hinihingi ng appropriations.

4473
03:50:27,880 --> 03:50:36,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ang hinihingi lang namin dito ay magkaroon ng commitment na magsasanggunian ang DBM at ang COA para may mga joint circulars.

4474
03:50:36,880 --> 03:50:43,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Lahat ng appropriations, allotments, obligations, disbursements, and balances will make it visible.

4475
03:50:43,880 --> 03:50:52,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Halimbawa sa DEF o sa kahit anong kapansanan, kahit sa mga katutubo, merong budget and financial accountability reports, BFARs.

4476
03:50:53,880 --> 03:50:58,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sana po, lagi natin sinasabi, yun na nga eh, no one left behind.

4477
03:50:58,880 --> 03:51:02,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Pero wala pong talagang nalileft behind na.

4478
03:51:02,880 --> 03:51:12,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa susunod na slide, ito po ang pangatlong aspeto, participation and inclusiveness.

4479
03:51:12,880 --> 03:51:17,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kailangan po talaga kaya kami lahat nandito, kaya ang dami-dami namin gustong magsalita.

4480
03:51:17,880 --> 03:51:23,040
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Kasi gustong namin makibahagi at masabi sa inyo yung

4481
03:51:23,040 --> 03:51:28,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sakit sa puso namin at yung hinanakit namin, lahat na yung nangyari sa house.

4482
03:51:28,880 --> 03:51:37,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Isa pong prinsipyo ang accessibility sa lahat, ang tawag sa kanya universal design. It's for everyone.

4483
03:51:37,880 --> 03:51:39,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: And we want to see that.

4484
03:51:40,880 --> 03:51:41,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Halimbawa lang.

4485
03:51:41,880 --> 03:51:48,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sa DEF, National Technical Working Group. Hindi kinutsulta. Gawa tayong national training.

4486
03:51:48,880 --> 03:51:50,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Isa lang ang organisasyon na tinanong.

4487
03:51:50,880 --> 03:51:52,860
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang tinanong. Ang mga

4488
03:51:52,860 --> 03:51:54,800
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: deaf, nakaabot na sa Supreme

4489
03:51:54,800 --> 03:51:56,980
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Court, nag-issue na ng Supreme Court

4490
03:51:56,980 --> 03:51:58,480
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: rules on interpreting.

4491
03:51:59,180 --> 03:52:00,720
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ito pa rin, gapang pa rin para

4492
03:52:00,720 --> 03:52:02,880
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: kumuha ng interpreter. Hindi ibig

4493
03:52:02,880 --> 03:52:05,120
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: sabihin na meron na tayong

4494
03:52:05,120 --> 03:52:06,800
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: mga polisya ay

4495
03:52:06,800 --> 03:52:07,740
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: automatic na.

4496
03:52:08,920 --> 03:52:09,640
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Sana po,

4497
03:52:10,780 --> 03:52:11,840
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: isa pang halimbawa,

4498
03:52:12,640 --> 03:52:14,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: ang mismong ating mahal na senador,

4499
03:52:14,580 --> 03:52:16,660
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Ping Lacson, 100 million

4500
03:52:16,660 --> 03:52:18,420
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: for instructional materials

4501
03:52:18,420 --> 03:52:20,420
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: for learners with disabilities

4502
03:52:20,420 --> 03:52:22,080
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: mulang 2010 pa yan.

4503
03:52:22,260 --> 03:52:24,580
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: Taon-taon, hindi makikita

4504
03:52:24,580 --> 03:52:26,460
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: kung nasa niyang 100 million

4505
03:52:26,460 --> 03:52:28,180
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: na yan. Hanggang ngayon,

4506
03:52:28,600 --> 03:52:30,400
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: halos isumatotal mo na yun,

4507
03:52:30,600 --> 03:52:31,720
Filipino Sign Language National Network Convenor Dr. Liza B. Martinez: isang billion na yun.

