4739
04:00:30,500 --> 04:00:34,520
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: compared to the drought projections of Pag-Asa itself

4740
04:00:34,520 --> 04:00:36,660
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: that they shared a couple of weeks ago only.

4741
04:00:36,820 --> 04:00:39,180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: This is the October latest version of Pag-Asa's drought.

4742
04:00:39,660 --> 04:00:42,500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Kitang-kita naman po, mas kulay blue,

4743
04:00:42,880 --> 04:00:44,500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: mas mataas ang budget allocation.

4744
04:00:44,920 --> 04:00:46,760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ito po ay galing sa HGAB.

4745
04:00:47,400 --> 04:00:50,460
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Mas red, mas malakas ang chance ang magkakadroughts.

4746
04:00:50,780 --> 04:00:53,400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: By March 2027, wala po tayong takas.

4747
04:00:53,680 --> 04:00:55,700
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Every single province will be,

4748
04:00:55,720 --> 04:00:57,060
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: suffering droughts.

4749
04:00:57,720 --> 04:00:59,500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pinapakita po natin yung October 2026

4750
04:00:59,500 --> 04:01:01,980
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: kahit di po talaga siya sakot palagan ng 2027 budget

4751
04:01:01,980 --> 04:01:05,360
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: dahil ito pong mga pabinsya na ito na ating minakahan sa bilog,

4752
04:01:05,720 --> 04:01:07,340
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ito po ang mga unang tatamaan ng droughts.

4753
04:01:07,420 --> 04:01:09,040
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: At tinatamaan na po sila ng droughts.

4754
04:01:09,280 --> 04:01:10,960
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Bicol, Eastern Visayas.

4755
04:01:11,600 --> 04:01:14,640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Sila po ba ang dapat makuha ng budget,

4756
04:01:15,240 --> 04:01:17,740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: prioritization-wise, sa water infrastructure?

4757
04:01:18,100 --> 04:01:19,200
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ipa pa pong irrigation dito.

4758
04:01:19,340 --> 04:01:21,480
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: This is just water infrastructure projects of DPWH.

4759
04:01:21,480 --> 04:01:25,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Rainwater harvesting and solar water pumps, among others.

4760
04:01:25,720 --> 04:01:27,720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pero kung tina po natin yung January 2027,

4761
04:01:27,720 --> 04:01:32,480
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Western Visayas, Mindoro, sila rin po ang ilang unang tatamaan ng droughts.

4762
04:01:32,480 --> 04:01:36,840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But are they getting the biggest cut of the water infrastructure project of DPWH?

4763
04:01:37,380 --> 04:01:37,720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: No.

4764
04:01:38,380 --> 04:01:42,000
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, this is another example of the needs-based assessment

4765
04:01:42,000 --> 04:01:44,880
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: na kailangan gawin sa lahat ng proyekta ng gobyerno.

4766
04:01:45,200 --> 04:01:49,100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ito po ay nasa Section 40 ng GAAM mismo ng 2026

4767
04:01:49,100 --> 04:01:50,220
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: and it's even in the NEP.

4768
04:01:50,220 --> 04:01:54,600
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: All government projects, multi-probabilistic assessment.

4769
04:01:54,600 --> 04:01:57,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Dapat may ganun po, needs-based.

4770
04:01:57,760 --> 04:01:59,220
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Nasa GAAM po yan at nasa NEP.

4771
04:01:59,900 --> 04:02:02,780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, ito sa ipotong halimbawa ng needs-based assessment na kailangan gawin.

4772
04:02:03,080 --> 04:02:03,760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Next slide, please.

4773
04:02:05,360 --> 04:02:10,400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Here's another interesting thing that I'm honestly surprised has not been mentioned as much so far.

4774
04:02:10,840 --> 04:02:12,180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Let's talk about nature-based solutions.

4775
04:02:12,640 --> 04:02:16,820
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: One of the newest buzzwords when it comes to the climate and environment sector in this country.

4776
04:02:17,720 --> 04:02:19,800
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Alam naman po natin na kulang na kulang po sa pondo.

4777
04:02:20,520 --> 04:02:22,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, what I would try to do instead is give you numbers.

4778
04:02:23,700 --> 04:02:24,520
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Last year,

4779
04:02:24,600 --> 04:02:28,840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: wala pa pong kongkretong estimate ng nature-based solutions funding sa Pilipinas.

4780
04:02:29,560 --> 04:02:31,740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, the closest for us in action climate that we got

4781
04:02:31,740 --> 04:02:35,560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: is NCCAP or National Climate Change Action Plan Goal No. 3

4782
04:02:35,560 --> 04:02:38,840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: which corresponds to ecological and environmental stability.

4783
04:02:39,260 --> 04:02:42,820
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: All environmental projects are under Goal 3 of NCCAP.

4784
04:02:43,740 --> 04:02:46,120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: It's only 0.12% of this year's GAAM.

4785
04:02:46,980 --> 04:02:52,760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ang ASEAN public expenditures percentage for nature-based solutions, 0.64%.

4786
04:02:52,760 --> 04:02:53,680
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: If we do the math,

4787
04:02:53,680 --> 04:02:55,160
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ibig sabihin po niyan,

4788
04:02:55,920 --> 04:02:58,320
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 8 billion for 2026 GAAM ang nature-based solutions,

4789
04:02:58,480 --> 04:02:59,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: well, scale-wise,

4790
04:02:59,880 --> 04:03:01,120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: kasi wala pa pong kongkretong estimate,

4791
04:03:01,380 --> 04:03:04,980
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: pero ang ASEAN public expenditures for nature-based solutions,

4792
04:03:05,560 --> 04:03:07,700
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 43 billion ang katumbas niya sa GAAM.

4793
04:03:08,200 --> 04:03:09,740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And if we apply it to this year's NEP,

4794
04:03:10,220 --> 04:03:11,120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 7.2 billion,

4795
04:03:11,480 --> 04:03:13,240
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: that would be 46 billion.

4796
04:03:13,840 --> 04:03:17,560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Sinabi po ni Yusek Anate na ang kasunod ko yung budget po ng DNR,

4797
04:03:18,260 --> 04:03:20,300
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 1.7 billion lamang.

4798
04:03:20,720 --> 04:03:22,720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: That's a lot of money still,

4799
04:03:22,720 --> 04:03:23,640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: but that's not enough.

4800
04:03:24,220 --> 04:03:25,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And that's just DNR.

4801
04:03:25,560 --> 04:03:28,640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pero yung scale po nung 0.12% versus 0.64%,

4802
04:03:29,340 --> 04:03:31,780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 1.7 billion versus 46 billion,

4803
04:03:32,180 --> 04:03:33,760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: simply not enough.

4804
04:03:36,460 --> 04:03:40,880
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Kung kaya po ng camera na magmanipulan ng daang-daang bilyong piso para sa infra-projects,

4805
04:03:40,980 --> 04:03:44,380
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: what is stopping anyone from allotting more to nature-based solutions?

4806
04:03:45,760 --> 04:03:46,440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Next slide, please.

4807
04:03:47,480 --> 04:03:49,100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And that's why to our esteemed senators,

4808
04:03:49,220 --> 04:03:50,560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: we'd like to forward the following recommendations.

4809
04:03:50,560 --> 04:03:53,560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: To further super El Nino-proof our nationalization,

4810
04:03:53,680 --> 04:03:54,840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: our national budget for next year.

4811
