Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But ang nagtatagpo ng program,

4846
04:05:23,720 --> 04:05:24,080
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: projects,

4847
04:05:24,200 --> 04:05:25,460
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ay hindi CCC at DBM lang.

4848
04:05:25,820 --> 04:05:27,900
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Every agency tags their own projects.

4849
04:05:28,240 --> 04:05:29,780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So we'd just like to share these reports.

