04:24:36,400 --> 04:24:37,560
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Then, we'll send po that team din.

5408
04:24:37,640 --> 04:24:38,020
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Salamat po.

