5577
04:31:39,360 --> 04:31:47,780
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: It is clear that such imposes challenges on culture and heritage, such as vulnerabilities to deterioration, disaster risk management,

5578
04:31:48,240 --> 04:31:55,800
