5594
04:33:43,500 --> 04:33:58,160
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Such lack of funding represents a missed opportunity to develop existing heritage assets into productive public infrastructure that serves both cultural preservation and community development.

5595
04:33:58,160 --> 04:34:25,240
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: This is clearly evident in what Ms. Jabel has mentioned about DPWH basic infrastructure programs budget cuts for foreign-assisted public transportation projects. So, the potential of integrating public transportation with sustainable urban planning with adaptive reuse of built heritage remains unrecognized in the proposed budget allocations. So, next slide po.

