Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: That's a part of Intramuros na katabi lamang po yan, Manila Cathedral.

5600
04:34:40,040 --> 04:34:53,640
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: At a time of hefty fork insert, our leaders should also recognize the potential existing heritage structures as an alternative or complement to new construction.

5601
04:34:54,420 --> 04:34:57,380
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Such investments can preserve irreplaceable cultural heritage.

5602
04:34:58,620 --> 04:35:09,820
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: While creating opportunities for public services, local employment, commercial activity, tourism, and community-oriented urban renewal.

5603
04:35:10,360 --> 04:35:17,380
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: And can be concretely repurposed as museums, libraries, cultural centers, kahit nga po health center at housing.

5604
04:35:18,540 --> 04:35:22,220
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Yung mga underutilized na structures natin, pwede pa palang magamit.

5605
04:35:22,560 --> 04:35:27,220
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Imbes na gumawa tayo ng panibagong multipurpose building worth 100 million, 300 million.

5606
04:35:27,380 --> 04:35:30,320
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: 400 million at 500 million.

5607
04:35:30,820 --> 04:35:37,380
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Mas malaki pa yung mga presyo na yun kesa sa iisang pondo ng isang national cultural agency.

5608
04:35:38,960 --> 04:35:43,520
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Tourism and heritage is the way to market our country.

5609
04:35:43,840 --> 04:35:45,300
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: This is an investment.

5610
04:35:46,160 --> 04:35:52,140
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Heritage conservation should therefore be considered not merely for the beautification of old buildings,

5611
04:35:52,140 --> 04:35:57,140
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: but a component of a broader public investment strategy that makes existence,

5612
04:35:57,380 --> 04:36:01,880
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: existing assets, useful, accessible, and economically productive.

5613
04:36:02,560 --> 04:36:09,120
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Surely, proud po ang ating Senate President Will Gatchel yan sa heritage-focused successes ng Valenzuela ngayon.

5614
04:36:09,800 --> 04:36:17,720
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Furthermore, this organization firmly believes that built heritage should be part of modern Filipino society.

5615
04:36:18,460 --> 04:36:26,600
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: This can be possible through cultural heritage tourism, adaptive reuse of heritage structure as productive public spaces,

5616
04:36:26,600 --> 04:36:33,600
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: investments can stimulate local economies, create livelihoods, and attract continued economic activity,

5617
04:36:34,540 --> 04:36:38,600
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: lalo na ngayon na ang baba ng US dollar rate natin.

5618
04:36:39,740 --> 04:36:46,600
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: So baka naman tumaas-taas ang value ng peso kapag ka mas magrabing bongga ang ating funding for our heritage.

5619
04:36:46,600 --> 04:36:56,580
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: With sustained budgetary support, these benefits can extend beyond immediate tourism revenues to deliver long-term returns.

5620
04:36:56,600 --> 04:37:04,800
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Making heritage conservation a strategic investment in inclusive economic development rather than a discretionary expenditure.

5621
04:37:05,820 --> 04:37:12,800
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: So ito po ang short-term interventions na baka po pwede pong mabigyang focus ng ating butihing mga senador.

5622
04:37:13,600 --> 04:37:26,580
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Una sa lahat, i-review at i-scrutinize ang over P541 billion peso BARSc pork funds with multi-purpose buildings worth P42.7 billion.

5623
04:37:26,600 --> 04:37:34,160
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: And reallocate back to foreign-assistant projects, El Nino, DRRM, Healthcare and Heritage.

5624
04:37:34,820 --> 04:37:44,360
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Also, scrutinize national expenditure program to H-GAB Third Reading Fund jumps with 2,805 potential insertion candidates

5625
04:37:44,360 --> 04:37:50,760
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: with numerous multi-purpose building projects individually worth P100 million to P500 million

5626
04:37:50,760 --> 04:37:56,580
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: despite cultural agencies only receiving P150 million for 2027.

5627
04:37:56,600 --> 04:38:07,940
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: And lastly, kung kayang maka-afford na magpondo ng multi-purpose buildings na yan individually na P100 million, P300 million, P400 million, P500 million,

5628
04:38:08,340 --> 04:38:15,360
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: sigurado namang pwede nating mataasan ang pondo ng cultural agencies natin, most especially nasa NCCA.

5629
04:38:15,560 --> 04:38:16,540
Renacimiento Manila Representative Bea Dolores: Thank you so much.

5630
04:38:17,800 --> 04:38:20,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Crispia Dolores.

5631
04:38:20,180 --> 04:38:25,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for your advocacy to preserve heritage and culture.

5632
04:38:26,600 --> 04:38:29,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero that's very important, no?

5633
04:38:30,340 --> 04:38:34,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ako na sa San Juan, where, of course, it's a small city, it's a small town.

5634
04:38:34,840 --> 04:38:43,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That time when I became mayor pa yun, yung historical significance, that's why nag-ano kami yung Museo na Katipunan,

5635
04:38:43,240 --> 04:38:48,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that was my project na, syempre, dedicated to our katipuneros.

5636
04:38:48,820 --> 04:38:54,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos yung mga nilagay ko yung bandayog nila, Andres Bonifacio, Mio Sindo for our youth.

5637
04:38:55,560 --> 04:38:56,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na ano pa nga ako noon eh.

5638
04:38:56,600 --> 04:38:59,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sabi eh, yung mga pinapatayo ko, iputan lang daw ng ibon.

5639
04:39:00,020 --> 04:39:00,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ewan ko ba.

5640
04:39:02,320 --> 04:39:10,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam mo, the sad reality, kaya walang masyadong may gusto sa history na mga public official, wala kasing boto dyan eh.

5641
04:39:11,960 --> 04:39:17,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan lang, mahal mo talaga yung bayan mo, yung culture and history for you to really appreciate and preserve.

5642
04:39:17,260 --> 04:39:19,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But thank you for your advocacy.

5643
04:39:19,620 --> 04:39:22,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Syempre, meron, di naman talaga ano, importante talaga yan.

5644
04:39:23,360 --> 04:39:24,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you very much for that.

5645
04:39:25,480 --> 04:39:26,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Last but not the least, Pablo.

5646
04:39:26,600 --> 04:39:32,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Public Services Labor Independent Confederation or PSLINK, Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron.

5647
04:39:33,000 --> 04:39:34,740
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Maraming maraming salamat po.

5648
04:39:34,860 --> 04:39:37,260
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ako po lang ang namamagitan sa uwian.

5649
04:39:38,160 --> 04:39:41,740
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At kaya akin pong iiklian.

5650
04:39:42,380 --> 04:39:45,360
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ako po si Annie Geron, Pangulo po ng PSLINK Public.

5651
04:39:45,780 --> 04:39:52,520
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At ang kinakatawan ko po dito ay Organisadong Hanay ng mga kawani ng pamahalaan.

5652
04:39:52,520 --> 04:39:56,160
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ibig sabihin kami po yung union sa sektor publiko.

5653
04:39:56,600 --> 04:40:05,200
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At mula po 2007, kami po ay aktibong bahagi ng Alternative Budget Initiative ng Social Watch Philippines.

5654
04:40:05,660 --> 04:40:08,780
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Na talaga pong tumitingin dito sa mga budget.

5655
04:40:09,660 --> 04:40:21,260
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ang aming pong pinakamatagal na layunin ay yung dekalidad na serbisyo publiko sa ilalim ng isang pamahalang bukas, tapat at may pananagutan.

5656
04:40:21,820 --> 04:40:24,700
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Narinig natin kanina yung lahat ng sinasabi.

5657
04:40:24,700 --> 04:40:35,640
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Pero gusto ko pong sabihin, Senator Lacson and Senator JB, sa pagkakataong ito, ang hirap maging kawani ng pamahalaan.

5658
04:40:36,560 --> 04:40:46,440
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Kanina, nabanggit po ninyo, kailangan ibalik natin ang tiwala ng bayan sa pamahalaan, sa mga opisyal at sa mga kawani.

5659
04:40:47,440 --> 04:40:49,580
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Pero hindi lang hunilamatan eh.

5660
04:40:49,840 --> 04:40:54,440
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Dinurog ng korupsyon yung tiwala ng bayan sa pamahalaan.

5661
04:40:54,700 --> 04:41:06,640
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At kailangan po natin ng dagliang ebidensya o resibo ng ating paglaban sa korupsyon.

5662
04:41:07,360 --> 04:41:16,680
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Katulad ng kailangan makita ng taong bayan na mayroon talagang nananagot at managot dito sa katiwalian.

5663
04:41:18,220 --> 04:41:24,680
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Yung mga nagsamantala, yung mga nagmalabis, yung hindi tubig ng bahay.

5664
04:41:24,700 --> 04:41:34,520
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Yung mga nagsamantala ang nilimas kung hindi nilimas yung pondo ng bayan, yun po kailangan talaga makita natin na makulong, managot.

5665
04:41:35,040 --> 04:41:43,700
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Hindi yung nagkakaroon pa ng espasyo para ipaliwanag at ikatwiran na marami naman daw sila magnanakaw bakit sila lang ang tinitira.

5666
04:41:43,920 --> 04:41:47,740
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: So alam ni Senator Ping Lacson kung sino yung tinutukoy ko.

5667
04:41:50,860 --> 04:41:53,380
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Parang hostifikasyon.

5668
04:41:53,380 --> 04:41:58,600
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Pero ano po yung isa pang dahilan kung bakit mahirap na kawani ng pamahalaan?

5669
04:41:59,320 --> 04:42:05,920
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Kasi po, alam niyo na yung mga kawani ang nasa bukana ng paghatid ng serbisyo publiko.

5670
04:42:06,800 --> 04:42:17,880
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Pero mahirap po sapagkat kung kulang ang pondo, kulang ang kagamitan mo, kulang ang bilang ng mga kawani para doon sa mga paghatid ng serbisyo publiko.

5671
04:42:19,000 --> 04:42:21,660
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: So bumaba ba po rin yung kalidad?

5672
04:42:21,660 --> 04:42:28,600
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At dahil nga po sa korupsyon, pag humaharap ka sa komunidad at kulang yung gamit mo, pagdududahan ka eh.

5673
04:42:29,240 --> 04:42:33,260
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Eh siguro kaya kulang binulusan nyo na. O kaya kayo na ang nauna.

5674
04:42:34,400 --> 04:42:46,280
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ang isa pa pong hamon dito ay syempre sa punto de vista ng manggagawa, eh isang milyon na po ang kontraktwal sa sektor publiko.

5675
04:42:46,480 --> 04:42:49,480
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Mas marami pa po sila kaysa sa mga plantilya.

5676
04:42:49,840 --> 04:42:51,400
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: At alam po natin.

5677
04:42:51,660 --> 04:42:58,000
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Hindi sigurado ang kanilang trabaho at hindi nila alam kung bukas makalawa ay wala na silang trabaho.

5678
04:42:58,200 --> 04:43:08,300
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Kaya meron din pong epekto yan sa commitment doon sa pagsisikap ng mga tao sa paghatid ng serbisyo publiko.

5679
04:43:09,300 --> 04:43:16,160
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Babalikan ko lang po yung kaninang pinresent kasi magpapartikular po ako sa health, sa pangkalusugan.

5680
04:43:16,160 --> 04:43:21,440
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Sapagkat yan po yung sa akin pangunahing karapang-tampang tao yan eh.

5681
04:43:21,660 --> 04:43:29,460
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Hindi mo pwedeng na-enjoy yung right to education, right to work, right to life kung wala ho tayong mabuting kalusugan.

5682
04:43:30,440 --> 04:43:40,420
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: So sinabi po ni Dr. JP kanina na 250 billion taon-taon ang nakakalap mula sa direct contributors.

5683
04:43:41,520 --> 04:43:43,940
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Marami po dyan ang kontribusyon ng manggagawa.

5684
04:43:44,880 --> 04:43:50,060
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Hindi pa nahawakan ng sweldong kakarimpot, paltas na ang sa PhilHealth.

5685
04:43:50,060 --> 04:43:51,240
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: So naunawaan po namin.

5686
04:43:51,660 --> 04:43:58,600
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Hindi para lamang yan sa mga manggagawa kung hindi ito ay nagagamit para din po doon sa mga hindi kayang mag-contribute.

5687
04:43:59,180 --> 04:44:07,640
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Pero yung sinasabi ko po, Sen. Ping, Sen. JP, huwag naman talikuran ng gobyerno yung obligasyon niya at ipapasa.

5688
04:44:08,320 --> 04:44:17,700
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Dahil hindi niya po ponduhan ng maayos, hindi niya ibibigay yung share ng PhilHealth, ang [unclear], sa sin tax, sa PAGCOR, sa PCSO.

5689
04:44:18,100 --> 04:44:20,440
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Lumalabas po noon yung direct contributors.

5690
04:44:20,440 --> 04:44:27,500
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: Ang bumabalikat para doon sa mga indigent at non-contributors o indirect contributors.

5691
04:44:27,920 --> 04:44:31,440
PSLINK President Dr. Annie Enriquez-Geron: So sana makita po natin na hindi naman ito dapat.

