Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: By the way, yung sinabi ko

5932
04:52:49,760 --> 04:52:51,600
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: kanin, nagsisisi ako nalagpunta rito,

5933
04:52:52,040 --> 04:52:53,020
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: nagbibiro lang po ako.

5934
04:52:53,900 --> 04:52:55,420
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi maraming salamat,

5935
04:52:55,540 --> 04:52:56,240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: very informative,

5936
04:52:57,800 --> 04:52:59,320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: maraming nakaka-enlighten ba,

5937
04:53:00,040 --> 04:53:01,500
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: at saka nakakapagpalakas,

5938
04:53:01,580 --> 04:53:02,940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: nakapag-strengthen ang resolve.

5939
04:53:03,540 --> 04:53:05,400
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So kami, malakas yung aming

5940
04:53:05,400 --> 04:53:07,200
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: advocacy sa budget. Talagang

5941
04:53:07,200 --> 04:53:09,520
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: gusto namin malinis.

5942
04:53:10,200 --> 04:53:11,680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Pero ngayon, nadagdagan pa yung

5943
04:53:11,680 --> 04:53:13,420
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: resolve namin after hearing all of you.

5944
04:53:13,560 --> 04:53:14,340
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Maraming salamat po.

5945
04:53:15,960 --> 04:53:16,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

5946
04:53:17,440 --> 04:53:19,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I agree with Senator Lacson. Minsan,

5947
04:53:19,460 --> 04:53:21,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa dami ng problema, sa manarinig namin

5948
04:53:21,440 --> 04:53:22,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mga issues ngayon,

5949
04:53:23,340 --> 04:53:25,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: humihirap na mali ng Pilipinas.

5950
04:53:25,520 --> 04:53:26,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But on the other hand,

5951
04:53:26,920 --> 04:53:27,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sabi nga niya,

5952
04:53:27,800 --> 04:53:28,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ni Senator Lacson,

5953
04:53:29,460 --> 04:53:31,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pag naririnig naman yung passion nyo,

5954
04:53:31,320 --> 04:53:32,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung talagang dedication nyo,

5955
04:53:33,360 --> 04:53:36,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: syempre, masarap na lumaban pa rin.

5956
04:53:36,720 --> 04:53:37,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Laban lang tayo.

5957
04:53:37,700 --> 04:53:39,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kahit mahirap. Minsan,

5958
04:53:39,680 --> 04:53:41,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang ating challenge.

5959
04:53:41,400 --> 04:53:43,680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kung sila na kaya mag-takeover ng gobyerno.

5960
04:53:45,260 --> 04:53:46,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: O nga, para makapag-relax na.

5961
04:53:47,840 --> 04:53:48,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mahirap din sa gobyerno.

5962
04:53:48,980 --> 04:53:50,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag yung mga nagtatrabaho talaga,

5963
04:53:50,480 --> 04:53:51,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung pang nababatikos.

5964
04:53:52,340 --> 04:53:53,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya laban lang tayo.

5965
04:53:54,520 --> 04:53:56,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron lang konti katanungan.

5966
04:53:56,240 --> 04:53:57,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anybody can answer?

5967
04:53:57,800 --> 04:54:00,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Before we adjourn today.

5968
04:54:01,560 --> 04:54:04,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun sa ilang beses nabanggit kasi kanina

5969
04:54:04,340 --> 04:54:05,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tungkol sa ayuda.

5970
04:54:06,040 --> 04:54:10,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, pwede sila Kenneth or si AJ.

5971
04:54:11,160 --> 04:54:12,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Or any.

5972
04:54:12,240 --> 04:54:13,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Si Dr. Raquiza.

5973
04:54:13,300 --> 04:54:14,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Wala na si Manibig.

5974
04:54:14,460 --> 04:54:17,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Do we have any study on the economic impact

5975
04:54:17,300 --> 04:54:20,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of the financial assistance or ayuda?

5976
04:54:20,380 --> 04:54:23,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For example, for every billion spent on ayuda,

5977
04:54:23,280 --> 04:54:25,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: how much economic activity does it actually generate?

5978
04:54:26,400 --> 04:54:27,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron ba tayong ganung study?

5979
04:54:27,800 --> 04:54:33,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Whenever we ask agencies to justify their budgets for financial assistance,

5980
04:54:33,340 --> 04:54:35,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they always emphasize the importance of ayuda.

5981
04:54:36,740 --> 04:54:40,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Especially with the ongoing oil crisis and the threat of super-L-linio.

5982
04:54:40,120 --> 04:54:46,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron ba tayong ganun study sa economic impact or financial assistance of yung ayuda?

5983
04:54:47,480 --> 04:54:48,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Salamat po, Chair JV.

5984
04:54:49,440 --> 04:54:53,640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: To answer it very quickly, we don't have good studies po.

5985
04:54:53,640 --> 04:54:57,320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Ang merong nag-aaral po on this subject is yung PIDS po.

5986
04:54:57,320 --> 04:54:59,260
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Yung Philippine Institute for Development Studies.

5987
04:54:59,360 --> 04:55:01,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: They're currently doing studies on the MAIFIP on the AICS.

5988
04:55:02,480 --> 04:55:05,720
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Medyo nakapagtataka kung bakit ngayon lang po ito nangyari

5989
04:55:05,720 --> 04:55:08,180
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: because we've been adding more and more money.

5990
04:55:08,760 --> 04:55:11,960
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Our colleagues from the health sector, they've done some studies on the MAIFIP.

5991
04:55:12,360 --> 04:55:14,780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Ang nakita po nila ay karamihan po ng MAIFIP funds

5992
04:55:14,780 --> 04:55:18,740
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: ay nagpupunta sa mga middle or upper class na patients.

5993
04:55:18,920 --> 04:55:21,320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Hindi po siya nagpupunta sa mga mahihirap na pasyente.

5994
04:55:21,900 --> 04:55:25,500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: On the other hand, yung mga rules-based social protection like yung 4Ps,

5995
04:55:25,740 --> 04:55:27,300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: marami pong mga international studies,

5996
04:55:27,320 --> 04:55:30,560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: that really show how effective po yung 4Ps is.

5997
04:55:30,840 --> 04:55:32,480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: So that's really what we're advocating for,

5998
04:55:32,600 --> 04:55:36,060
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: na ilipat po yung pondo away from itong mga discretionary AICs

5999
04:55:36,060 --> 04:55:39,560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: at mas dagdagan at suportahan po natin yung 4Ps na program.

6000
04:55:40,520 --> 04:55:41,280
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Maybe I can help you.

6001
04:55:41,660 --> 04:55:42,700
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Adolfo Jose Montesa: Hi, si Ken po.

6002
04:55:42,940 --> 04:55:43,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sige.

6003
04:55:44,820 --> 04:55:46,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, si...

6004
04:55:46,960 --> 04:55:47,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sino ba niya?

6005
04:55:48,020 --> 04:55:48,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ken.

6006
04:55:49,460 --> 04:55:50,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ken Abante.

6007
04:55:50,760 --> 04:55:53,160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We can send you a copy of this study, Senator JV.

6008
04:55:53,500 --> 04:55:56,680
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: There was a recent World Bank study that talked about cost-effectiveness

6009
04:55:56,680 --> 04:55:58,400
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: of different social protection programs,

6010
04:55:58,500 --> 04:56:03,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: of which yung 4Ps nga po was the most effective of all the social protection programs.

6011
04:56:04,120 --> 04:56:05,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Incidentally, in that same chart,

6012
04:56:06,040 --> 04:56:11,300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: you can also see how less effective the other programs are,

6013
04:56:11,400 --> 04:56:12,780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: including MAIFIP and AICs.

6014
04:56:13,100 --> 04:56:16,520
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So may kita niyo po doon yung current state ng evidence,

6015
04:56:16,740 --> 04:56:17,400
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: at least there.

6016
04:56:17,500 --> 04:56:19,520
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: I will send you and your staff a copy of the study.

6017
04:56:19,700 --> 04:56:20,200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Thank you, Sen.

6018
04:56:20,840 --> 04:56:21,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for that.

6019
04:56:21,640 --> 04:56:25,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will need that siguro pa if you can send this committee.

6020
04:56:26,680 --> 04:56:28,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, dito sa nakita namin,

6021
04:56:29,060 --> 04:56:31,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nag-uusap namin sa Senator Lacson,

6022
04:56:31,380 --> 04:56:33,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sen. President Gachalian,

6023
04:56:34,680 --> 04:56:39,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: although admittedly, we still need to have those social programs.

6024
04:56:40,100 --> 04:56:41,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil nga may El Niño tayo,

6025
04:56:41,640 --> 04:56:42,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: meron tayong crisis,

6026
04:56:42,760 --> 04:56:44,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pero ang sa akin lang,

6027
04:56:44,720 --> 04:56:45,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: personally, sa akin po ito,

6028
04:56:46,520 --> 04:56:47,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: huwag naman lahat po sa ayuda.

6029
04:56:47,860 --> 04:56:48,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi naman bumuhay.

6030
04:56:48,760 --> 04:56:49,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Aasa tayo sa ayuda eh.

6031
04:56:50,340 --> 04:56:50,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba?

6032
04:56:50,720 --> 04:56:51,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is not sustainable.

6033
04:56:52,120 --> 04:56:53,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon pa rin po ako sa...

6034
04:56:53,960 --> 04:56:55,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sana kung mabalansin natin,

6035
04:56:55,760 --> 04:57:00,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: huwag natin kalimutan yung mga legacy projects.

6036
04:57:00,180 --> 04:57:00,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo na yung mga...

6037
04:57:00,960 --> 04:57:04,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Those that will really stimulate economic growth.

6038
04:57:04,560 --> 04:57:09,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo na yung magpapasiglan ng ekonomi natin in the future.

6039
04:57:09,880 --> 04:57:11,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya doon pa rin ako sa infra.

6040
04:57:11,400 --> 04:57:12,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Talagang hindi natin pwedeng pabaya.

6041
04:57:13,100 --> 04:57:14,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It may cost, yes, definitely,

6042
04:57:14,900 --> 04:57:19,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but the returns to the economy will be enormous in the future.

6043
04:57:19,300 --> 04:57:19,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba?

6044
04:57:19,940 --> 04:57:21,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi naman ito rocket science.

6045
04:57:21,280 --> 04:57:24,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan ang ginawa ng ASEAN neighbors natin.

6046
04:57:24,300 --> 04:57:24,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba?

6047
04:57:25,040 --> 04:57:25,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Malaysia,

6048
04:57:25,480 --> 04:57:26,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Indonesia,

6049
04:57:26,580 --> 04:57:27,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: even Vietnam now.

6050
04:57:27,840 --> 04:57:28,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya napag-iwan.

6051
04:57:29,300 --> 04:57:30,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya tayo naghahabol ngayon.

6052
04:57:31,100 --> 04:57:32,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sila nag-invest na 30 years ago.

6053
04:57:33,260 --> 04:57:34,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dapat noon pa natin ginawa ito.

6054
04:57:35,540 --> 04:57:38,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Quickly lang sa anybody from the health sector.

6055
04:57:39,480 --> 04:57:41,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro ikabit na natin ito.

6056
04:57:42,460 --> 04:57:47,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: One of the reasons being cited to justify a higher allocation for the MAIFIP

6057
04:57:47,000 --> 04:57:48,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or Medical Assistance Program

6058
04:57:48,100 --> 04:57:53,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is the rising cost of healthcare or medical inflation.

6059
04:57:53,280 --> 04:57:55,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But based on the reports we're receiving,

6060
04:57:55,060 --> 04:57:59,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: medical bills nowadays often reach five to six figures

6061
04:57:59,640 --> 04:58:03,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: even for relatively common illnesses.

6062
04:58:03,480 --> 04:58:05,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So from your end, are you seeing the same trend?

6063
04:58:05,780 --> 04:58:10,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Do you have data showing how much hospital bills have increased in recent years?

6064
04:58:10,700 --> 04:58:15,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And whether the rising cost of hospitalization justifies a higher budget for medical assistance?

6065
04:58:15,880 --> 04:58:20,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May nagsabi kasi sa amin that yung MAIFIP in the long run,

6066
04:58:20,200 --> 04:58:24,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and dahil ngayon, nagkakos na medical inflation, tumataas ng cost.

6067
04:58:25,060 --> 04:58:28,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang singil ng ospital, professional fees.

6068
04:58:28,960 --> 04:58:32,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron din akong nakausap, Senator Lacson, mayor galing sa Isabela,

6069
04:58:33,020 --> 04:58:33,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sabi sa akin,

6070
04:58:34,460 --> 04:58:37,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: alam mo, Sen, dati yung MAIFIP, mabigyan kami ng 3 million.

6071
04:58:37,800 --> 04:58:39,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang tagal na noon, dami namin natutulungan.

6072
04:58:40,380 --> 04:58:41,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngayon, kakaunti na lang.

6073
04:58:42,100 --> 04:58:44,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung hospital bills daw, hindi bumababa ng six digits.

6074
04:58:45,840 --> 04:58:48,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So siguro, Dr. Albert Ong, quickly, that's it.

6075
04:58:49,280 --> 04:58:52,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung MAIFIP ba talaga may study na nagkakos na medical inflation?

6076
04:58:52,080 --> 04:58:52,720
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Sige po.

6077
04:58:52,780 --> 04:58:54,780
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Siguro, i-a-anchor ko rin po ito.

6078
04:58:54,780 --> 04:58:57,980
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Doon sa ano ba yung purpose po nung ibang provision sa UHC Act.

6079
04:58:58,280 --> 04:58:59,960
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Kung matatanda po natin sa UHC Act,

6080
04:59:00,880 --> 04:59:03,880
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: ang isa po sa reform doon ay lahat po ng mga funding for health,

6081
04:59:03,980 --> 04:59:09,060
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: like PagCorp, PCS, o ang vision ay lahat po ay sa PhilHealth na lang siya,

6082
04:59:09,140 --> 04:59:11,140
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: or sa isang fund na lang siya.

6083
04:59:11,260 --> 04:59:17,020
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Kasi ang vision natin sa healthcare is we should have a single-payer health system,

6084
04:59:17,180 --> 04:59:20,680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: meaning PhilHealth lang ang nagbabayad sa health system.

6085
04:59:21,600 --> 04:59:22,260
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Bakit po?

6086
04:59:22,400 --> 04:59:23,680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Kasi isa sa mga...

6087
04:59:24,780 --> 04:59:28,560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Purposes or isa sa mga functions po ng social health insurance like PhilHealth

6088
04:59:28,560 --> 04:59:32,860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: is also to contain the cost of health services.

6089
04:59:33,360 --> 04:59:37,820
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Ngayon, kung fragmented po ang mga sources of funds,

6090
04:59:37,940 --> 04:59:40,440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: like meron tayong MAIFIP, meron tayong PhilHealth,

6091
04:59:40,580 --> 04:59:43,020
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: meron tayong PCSO and PagCorp, et cetera,

6092
04:59:43,460 --> 04:59:44,920
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: parang fragmented yung sources ng ano.

6093
04:59:45,060 --> 04:59:47,320
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Parang walang masyadong leverage yung government

6094
04:59:47,320 --> 04:59:54,300
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to negotiate the prices of the health products,

6095
04:59:54,300 --> 04:59:56,200
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: health technologies, and health services po.

6096
04:59:56,420 --> 04:59:59,940
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So, by carving out...

6097
04:59:59,940 --> 05:00:06,000
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: or by having MAIFIP or other financial assistance funding,

6098
05:00:06,380 --> 05:00:10,320
